{
  "id": "a1-05",
  "level": "A1",
  "number": 5,
  "title": "Articles & plurals",
  "titleAf": "Lidwoorde en meervoude",
  "icon": "📚",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "a1-05-1",
      "title": "die and 'n",
      "explanation": [
        "**die** = the (for every noun, singular or plural, with no gender!)",
        "**'n** = a / an.",
        "At the start of a sentence, **'n** stays lower-case and the *next* word gets the capital: **'n Hond blaf.** (A dog is barking.)"
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "Die hond is groot.", "en": "The dog is big." },
        { "af": "Ek het 'n kat.", "en": "I have a cat." },
        { "af": "'n Man en 'n vrou.", "en": "A man and a woman." }
      ],
      "vocab": ["die", "'n", "hond", "kat", "man", "vrou", "kind", "huis", "boek"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "fill", "af": "___ hond is groot.", "en": "The dog is big.", "answers": ["Die"], "options": ["Die", "'n", "Dit"] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "I have a cat.", "answers": ["Ek het 'n kat."] },
        { "type": "choice", "question": "How many words for \"the\" does Afrikaans have?", "options": ["One: die", "Two: die and het", "Three: der, die, das"], "answer": "One: die" },
        { "type": "order", "en": "A man and a woman.", "af": "'n Man en 'n vrou." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-05-2",
      "title": "Making plurals",
      "explanation": [
        "Most nouns add **-e** or **-s**:",
        "**-e**: hond → **honde**, boek → **boeke**, huis → **huise**.",
        "**-s**: most words ending in -el, -er, -em, -ie, or a vowel: tafel → **tafels**, kamer → **kamers**, ma → **ma's**.",
        "Some double the consonant: kat → **katte**, pen → **penne**. Some change: dag → **dae**, stad → **stede**, kind → **kinders**.",
        "Check the plural in the dictionary: every noun entry shows it."
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "Die honde speel.", "en": "The dogs are playing." },
        { "af": "Ek het drie boeke.", "en": "I have three books." },
        { "af": "Die kinders is in die tuin.", "en": "The children are in the garden." }
      ],
      "vocab": ["tafel", "stoel", "kamer", "dag", "stad", "pen", "vriend", "tuin"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Ek het twee ___ (dogs).", "en": "I have two dogs.", "answers": ["honde"], "options": ["honde", "honds", "hondes"] },
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Die ___ (children) speel buite.", "en": "The children are playing outside.", "answers": ["kinders"], "options": ["kinders", "kinde", "kinds"] },
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Daar is vier ___ (tables).", "en": "There are four tables.", "answers": ["tafels"], "options": ["tafels", "tafele", "tafel"] },
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Die ___ (cats) slaap.", "en": "The cats are sleeping.", "answers": ["katte"], "options": ["katte", "kate", "kats"] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "I have three books.", "answers": ["Ek het drie boeke."] },
        { "type": "transform", "instruction": "Make it plural", "from": "Die stoel is nuut.", "answers": ["Die stoele is nuut."] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
